{"page":127,"width":1778,"height":2362,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 II 기본과 활용","words":[{"text":"과목","x":200,"y":101,"width":54,"height":27},{"text":"II","x":274,"y":101,"width":19,"height":28},{"text":"기본과","x":380,"y":100,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"활용","x":472,"y":99,"width":51,"height":31}]},{"text":"많은 시스템의 두되 역할을 하는 관계형 데이터베이스를 유일하게 접속할 수 있는 언어가 바로 바L이다. 사용자와","words":[{"text":"많은","x":234,"y":244,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"시스템의","x":301,"y":243,"width":102,"height":32},{"text":"두되","x":415,"y":242,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"역할을","x":480,"y":243,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"하는","x":569,"y":243,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"관계형","x":632,"y":242,"width":77,"height":34},{"text":"데이터베이스를","x":723,"y":243,"width":182,"height":33},{"text":"유일하게","x":916,"y":244,"width":105,"height":33},{"text":"접속할","x":1035,"y":244,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1124,"y":246,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"있는","x":1163,"y":244,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"언어가","x":1227,"y":244,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"바로","x":1320,"y":245,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"바L이다.","x":1385,"y":245,"width":116,"height":36},{"text":"사용자와","x":1514,"y":245,"width":113,"height":33}]},{"text":"개발자 입장에서는 SQIA 진화 및 변화가 가장 큰 관심사이다. 초창기 SQL의 기본 기능을 정리했던 최초의 SQL\u0026","words":[{"text":"개발자","x":201,"y":296,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"입장에서는","x":293,"y":295,"width":132,"height":33},{"text":"SQIA","x":434,"y":295,"width":79,"height":36},{"text":"진화","x":528,"y":295,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"및","x":590,"y":294,"width":24,"height":33},{"text":"변화가","x":628,"y":295,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"가장","x":719,"y":295,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"큰","x":781,"y":297,"width":27,"height":29},{"text":"관심사이다.","x":819,"y":294,"width":139,"height":33},{"text":"초창기","x":971,"y":295,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"SQL의","x":1061,"y":294,"width":79,"height":37},{"text":"기본","x":1155,"y":294,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"기능을","x":1220,"y":294,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"정리했던","x":1315,"y":295,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"최초의","x":1435,"y":294,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"SQL\u0026","x":1529,"y":298,"width":96,"height":33}]},{"text":"표준과 관계형 DBMS의 폭발적인 전성기를 주도했던 ANSI/ISO SQL2 세대를 지나면서 기술적으로 많은 발전이","words":[{"text":"표준과","x":200,"y":347,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"관계형","x":294,"y":346,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"DBMS의","x":388,"y":346,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"폭발적인","x":510,"y":346,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"전성기를","x":632,"y":346,"width":107,"height":33},{"text":"주도했던","x":750,"y":345,"width":109,"height":34},{"text":"ANSI/ISO","x":870,"y":349,"width":131,"height":32},{"text":"SQL2","x":1011,"y":349,"width":71,"height":33},{"text":"세대를","x":1094,"y":345,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"지나면서","x":1190,"y":346,"width":109,"height":33},{"text":"기술적으로","x":1315,"y":346,"width":141,"height":32},{"text":"많은","x":1468,"y":345,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"발전이","x":1536,"y":345,"width":86,"height":34}]},{"text":"있었다.","words":[{"text":"있었다.","x":201,"y":400,"width":91,"height":33}]},{"text":"그러나 ANSIASO 바12은 표준 SQL에 대한 명세가 부족한 부-분이 있었괴 DBMS 벤더별로 문법이나 사용되는","words":[{"text":"그러나","x":235,"y":453,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"ANSIASO","x":328,"y":455,"width":124,"height":31},{"text":"바12은","x":463,"y":453,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"표준","x":568,"y":453,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"SQL에","x":632,"y":452,"width":80,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":726,"y":451,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"명세가","x":790,"y":451,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"부족한","x":881,"y":451,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"부-분이","x":974,"y":451,"width":78,"height":32},{"text":"있었괴","x":1067,"y":450,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"DBMS","x":1168,"y":454,"width":85,"height":28},{"text":"벤더별로","x":1265,"y":452,"width":113,"height":32},{"text":"문법이나","x":1388,"y":450,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"사용되는","x":1511,"y":450,"width":116,"height":33}]},{"text":"용어의 차이가 너무 커져서 상호 호환성이나 SQL 학습 효율이 떨어지는 문제가 발생했다.","words":[{"text":"용어의","x":200,"y":505,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"차이가","x":299,"y":504,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"너무","x":396,"y":504,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"커져서","x":463,"y":504,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"상호","x":558,"y":504,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"호환성이나","x":626,"y":503,"width":138,"height":33},{"text":"SQL","x":777,"y":506,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"학습","x":848,"y":504,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"효율이","x":917,"y":504,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"떨어지는","x":1016,"y":503,"width":110,"height":33},{"text":"문제가","x":1139,"y":504,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"발생했다.","x":1240,"y":504,"width":121,"height":33}]},{"text":"이에 향후 바L에서 필요한 기능을 정리하고 호환 가능한 여러 기준을 제정한 것이 1999년에 정해진 ANSI/ISO","words":[{"text":"이에","x":237,"y":558,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"향후","x":302,"y":558,"width":54,"height":33},{"text":"바L에서","x":366,"y":557,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"필요한","x":486,"y":557,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"기능을","x":578,"y":557,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"정리하고","x":669,"y":556,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"호환","x":787,"y":555,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"가능한","x":854,"y":556,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"여러","x":948,"y":556,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"기준을","x":1014,"y":555,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"제정한","x":1106,"y":555,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"것이","x":1201,"y":555,"width":53,"height":34},{"text":"1999년에","x":1269,"y":556,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"정해진","x":1398,"y":555,"width":82,"height":34},{"text":"ANSI/ISO","x":1492,"y":557,"width":134,"height":32}]},{"text":"바13이다. 이후 가장 먼저 ANSI/ISO SQL3의 기능을 시현한 것이 OracIe의 8iPi 버전이라고 할 수 있다. 참고로","words":[{"text":"바13이다.","x":200,"y":610,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"이후","x":346,"y":610,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"가장","x":410,"y":609,"width":54,"height":34},{"text":"먼저","x":474,"y":609,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"ANSI/ISO","x":538,"y":612,"width":125,"height":31},{"text":"SQL3의","x":674,"y":608,"width":94,"height":37},{"text":"기능을","x":783,"y":608,"width":81,"height":33},{"text":"시현한","x":876,"y":608,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"것이","x":970,"y":608,"width":50,"height":33},{"text":"OracIe의","x":1034,"y":608,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"8iPi","x":1162,"y":610,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"버전이라고","x":1232,"y":608,"width":141,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":1383,"y":609,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"수","x":1423,"y":610,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"있다.","x":1463,"y":608,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"참고로","x":1541,"y":607,"width":86,"height":33}]},{"text":"2%3년에 ANSIASO SQL 기준이 소폭 추가개정됐다. 현재 사용되는 데이터베이스는 대부-분 SQL:2003 표준을","words":[{"text":"2%3년에","x":200,"y":662,"width":117,"height":32},{"text":"ANSIASO","x":329,"y":665,"width":127,"height":31},{"text":"SQL","x":468,"y":665,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"기준이","x":537,"y":661,"width":78,"height":33},{"text":"소폭","x":630,"y":663,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"추가개정됐다.","x":697,"y":660,"width":181,"height":33},{"text":"현재","x":895,"y":661,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"사용되는","x":962,"y":661,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"데이터베이스는","x":1088,"y":660,"width":195,"height":33},{"text":"대부-분","x":1297,"y":661,"width":84,"height":32},{"text":"SQL:2003","x":1394,"y":663,"width":129,"height":35},{"text":"표준을","x":1536,"y":661,"width":90,"height":31}]},{"text":"기준으로 하고 있다. 다른 벤더들의 DBMS도 2圄년 이후 발표된 버전에서 ANSI/ISO SQL-99와 SQL:2(X)3의","words":[{"text":"기준으로","x":202,"y":713,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"하고","x":324,"y":713,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":392,"y":714,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"다른","x":467,"y":714,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"벤더들의","x":535,"y":714,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"DBMS도","x":658,"y":717,"width":112,"height":27},{"text":"2圄년","x":782,"y":712,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"이후","x":886,"y":713,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"발표된","x":956,"y":713,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"버전에서","x":1052,"y":712,"width":108,"height":33},{"text":"ANSI/ISO","x":1174,"y":716,"width":135,"height":31},{"text":"SQL-99와","x":1322,"y":713,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"SQL:2(X)3의","x":1464,"y":712,"width":158,"height":37}]},{"text":"혁심 기능을 만족스러운 수준으로 지원하는 것으로 평가 받고 있다. 마지막으로 2%8년에 진행된 추가 개정 내용은","words":[{"text":"혁심","x":201,"y":766,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"기능을","x":267,"y":766,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"만족스러운","x":356,"y":766,"width":133,"height":32},{"text":"수준으로","x":498,"y":768,"width":109,"height":30},{"text":"지원하는","x":618,"y":767,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"것으로","x":737,"y":766,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"평가","x":828,"y":765,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"받고","x":894,"y":765,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"있다.","x":960,"y":765,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"마지막으로","x":1033,"y":765,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"2%8년에","x":1180,"y":765,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"진행된","x":1309,"y":766,"width":80,"height":33},{"text":"추가","x":1402,"y":766,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"개정","x":1472,"y":765,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"내용은","x":1540,"y":765,"width":86,"height":33}]},{"text":"아직 사용자 레벨에 큰 영향-을 미치지 않고 있다.","words":[{"text":"아직","x":200,"y":818,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"사용자","x":270,"y":818,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"레벨에","x":365,"y":817,"width":79,"height":33},{"text":"큰","x":458,"y":820,"width":28,"height":29},{"text":"영향-을","x":501,"y":818,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"미치지","x":597,"y":819,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"않고","x":694,"y":819,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":764,"y":817,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"아직도 번더별로 일부 기능의 개발이 진행중인 경우도 있괴 벤더별 특이한 기술 용어는 여전히 호환이 안 되고","words":[{"text":"아직도","x":236,"y":871,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"번더별로","x":327,"y":870,"width":106,"height":32},{"text":"일부","x":444,"y":870,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"기능의","x":509,"y":870,"width":78,"height":33},{"text":"개발이","x":600,"y":871,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"진행중인","x":694,"y":869,"width":106,"height":33},{"text":"경우도","x":814,"y":870,"width":82,"height":32},{"text"